## Source of Truth: unified-trading-pm/codex

ALL code changes must comply with `unified-trading-pm/codex/` principles. Finding the right doc (grep-native, L0→L4):
grep `unified-trading-pm/DOC_INDEX.generated.md` first (regen: `bash scripts/docs/refresh-doc-index.sh` if
stale/absent — never read it whole). Narrow with frontmatter facets, e.g.
`rg -l '^authoritative_for:.*<topic>' unified-trading-pm/codex/`. Full doctrine:
`unified-trading-pm/cursor-configs/CLAUDE.md` § "Doc retrieval". Key domain dirs:

- `06-coding-standards/` — quality gates, testing, contribution, dependencies
- `04-architecture/` — batch-live symmetry, deployment topology, concurrency (TIER-ARCHITECTURE.md)
- `03-observability/` — 3-tier event logging, alerting, monitoring
- `02-data/` — schema governance, subscription/publishing, partitioning

