## Citadel Import Rules (UAC Facade Pattern)

All consumer repos MUST import from UAC domain facades only:
- `from unified_api_contracts.execution import CanonicalOrder, CanonicalFill`
- `from unified_api_contracts.instruments import CanonicalInstrument`
- `from unified_api_contracts.normalize import normalize_order`

NEVER import from internal modules: `unified_api_contracts.canonical.*`, `unified_api_contracts.normalize_utils.*`,
`unified_api_contracts.shared.*`, `unified_api_contracts.config.*`. See `.cursor/rules/imports/uac-import-surface-enforcement.mdc`.

