## Dockerfile Standards

- Always use `asia-northeast1-docker.pkg.dev/${PROJECT_ID}/unified-trading-library/unified-trading-library:latest` as FROM base for Python services (never `python:3.13-slim`, never `ghcr.io/astral-sh/uv`, never bare `pip install uv` in Dockerfile)
- Always add `ARG PROJECT_ID` before the FROM line and `--platform=linux/amd64` to the FROM

---

## Analysis Rules

When analyzing codebase architecture:
- EXCLUDE: .venv*, venv/, node_modules/, build/, dist/, *.egg-info/
- EXCLUDE: Documentation files (*.md) when counting code usage
- EXCLUDE: Shell scripts when analyzing Python patterns
- FOCUS: Python source files in service directories only
- Use: `--glob '!.venv*' --glob '!**/.venv*/**'` with ripgrep
